.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt RAVEN-COMPLETION 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm raven-completion
.Nd print a shell completion script for raven
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar bash|zsh|fish
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes a completion script for
.Xr raven 1
to standard output.
The script is generated from the same command metadata used by
.Nm raven help ,
so it lists
.Cm version ,
.Cm help ,
.Cm completion
and every reserved command name.
.Pp
The output is a static shell script.
.Nm raven
does not evaluate the script, does not read shell configuration and does not execute any command
while generating it.
Install the script through the shell's normal completion directory or source it from the shell
startup file.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A missing or unknown shell argument exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr raven 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD modern userland contract, revision 1.
